        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "儲存時會刪除已儲存的密碼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server holds one encrypted file. Encrypt it with the backup password below; the desktop version of Motty reads the same file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器上只保存一个加密文件。使用下方的备份密码加密；桌面版 Motty 可以读取同一个文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "伺服器上只儲存一個加密檔案。使用下方的備份密碼加密；桌面版 Motty 可以讀取同一個檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file is not a Motty backup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这不是 Motty 备份文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這不是 Motty 備份檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This line uses syntax the catalog does not understand, so only history is offered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这一行使用了目录不认识的语法，因此只提供历史记录。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這一行使用了目錄不認識的語法，因此只提供歷史記錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This replaces the hosts and keys on this iPhone with the server's copy. The current ones are kept in config.db.before-restore. Close every terminal tab first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会用服务器上的副本替换此 iPhone 上的主机和私钥。当前数据会保留为 config.db.before-restore。请先关闭所有终端标签页。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這會用伺服器上的副本替換此 iPhone 上的主機和私密金鑰。當前資料會保留為 config.db.before-restore。請先關閉所有終端標籤頁。"
